    <main>
      <h2>About AI-Pulse</h2>
      <p>
        AI-Pulse monitors AI industry news and aggregates updates from official sources including OpenAI, Google DeepMind, Hugging Face, GitHub releases, Hacker News, and other reputable AI publications.
      </p>

      <h2>Editorial Standards</h2>
      <ul style="margin-left: 2rem;">
        <li>We use AI to summarize public information from cited sources</li>
        <li>We do not republish copyrighted content without proper attribution</li>
        <li>All direct citations are limited to under 15 words, with links to original sources</li>
        <li>We maintain editorial independence and do not accept payment for coverage</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
      <div class="important">
        <p>
          <strong>FTC Disclosure:</strong> Some articles may contain affiliate links to AI tools and services we genuinely use or recommend. We earn a commission at no extra cost to you when you make a purchase through our links. We never recommend products solely for commission and always prioritize reader value.
        </p>
      </div>
      <p>
        When we mention AI tools, SaaS products, or services, we aim to provide unbiased analysis. If an article includes an affiliate link, it will be clearly marked.
      </p>

      <h2>Content Policy</h2>
      <p>
        Our content covers:
      </p>
      <ul style="margin-left: 2rem;">
        <li>AI model releases and updates</li>
        <li>Tool comparisons and productivity tips</li>
        <li>Industry news and research announcements</li>
        <li>Developer resources and how-tos</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions or feedback? Reach out via <a href="https://github.com/svqnmtn76r-lang" target="_blank">GitHub</a> or <a href="https://x.com" target="_blank">X (Twitter)</a>.
      </p>

      <p style="margin-top: 3rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #999;">
        Last updated: 2026-05-25
      </p>
    </main>
